WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.303 --> 00:00:06.473
♪ (UPBEAT MUSIC PLAYS) ♪

00:00:11.044 --> 00:00:12.745
YVONNE ORJI:
<i>While I was getting my Master's,</i>

00:00:12.912 --> 00:00:13.879
<i> I entered a pageant.</i>

00:00:14.347 --> 00:00:16.449
<i> It was the Miss Nigeria
 in America Pageant.</i>

00:00:16.816 --> 00:00:20.153
<i> It's very specific,
 Nigerian in America.</i>

00:00:20.920 --> 00:00:22.388
<i> Two weeks before the pageant,</i>

00:00:22.489 --> 00:00:24.424
<i> they called and asked
 what my talent was.</i>

00:00:24.724 --> 00:00:26.392
<i> Now, when you're a child
 of immigrants,</i>

00:00:26.492 --> 00:00:27.727
<i> you're not allowed
 to have talents.</i>

00:00:27.827 --> 00:00:30.162
<i> Your only talent is just
 to get straight A's.</i>

00:00:30.262 --> 00:00:32.398
<i> The only thing I knew to play
 on the piano was</i>

00:00:32.498 --> 00:00:34.400
<i> "Mary Had A Little Lamb"
 and I just didn't think</i>

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:36.102
<i> that would cut it.
 So I was like,</i>

00:00:36.202 --> 00:00:38.170
<i> "God, I need a lifeline."</i>

00:00:38.270 --> 00:00:41.807
<i> And loud as day,
 I heard the voice of God say,</i>

00:00:41.907 --> 00:00:43.076
<i> "Do comedy."</i>

00:00:43.176 --> 00:00:46.378
<i> And I was like, "No.
 'Cause what? Am I funny?"</i>

00:00:46.812 --> 00:00:49.181
<i>And I heard the Holy Spirit say,
 "What else do you have?"</i>

00:00:49.281 --> 00:00:51.150
<i>And so I said, "I got nothing!"
 And he's like,</i>

00:00:51.250 --> 00:00:53.286
<i> "Well one day you're gonna
 trust me or you're not."</i>

00:00:54.220 --> 00:00:56.856
<i> I remember my first joke
 was, um,</i>

00:00:56.956 --> 00:00:58.590
<i> Nigerians don't know
 how to whisper,</i>

00:00:58.691 --> 00:01:01.794
<i> 'cause anytime a call
 comes from overseas,</i>

00:01:02.094 --> 00:01:04.964
<i> it's always: "Hello?!
 Can you hear me?</i>

00:01:05.764 --> 00:01:09.034
<i> Yes, no. I'm hearing you,
 but can you hear me?"</i>

00:01:09.134 --> 00:01:10.369
<i> And I was turning to my mom
 like,</i>

00:01:10.469 --> 00:01:12.538
<i> "Mom, everyone can hear you,
 'cause we're in church."</i>

00:01:13.105 --> 00:01:16.776
<i> People laughed and then I was
 like, "Am I actually funny,</i>

00:01:16.876 --> 00:01:18.211
<i> not around other Africans?"</i>

00:01:18.478 --> 00:01:20.480
<i> And then the best thing
 happened.</i>

00:01:20.580 --> 00:01:23.215
<i> There was a recession,
 so nobody else had a job.</i>

00:01:23.316 --> 00:01:26.219
<i> So I figured this could be
 my only chance</i>

00:01:26.319 --> 00:01:28.987
<i> to be poor
 with the rest of America,</i>

00:01:29.088 --> 00:01:30.923
<i> but be pursuing entertainment.</i>

00:01:31.023 --> 00:01:34.360
<i> And so I moved to New York
 to start comedy and acting.</i>

00:01:34.994 --> 00:01:38.530
<i> When I saw the breakdown
 for Molly on</i> Insecure,

00:01:38.630 --> 00:01:42.501
<i>I jumped at it because it said,
 "dark-skinned black woman</i>

00:01:42.601 --> 00:01:46.438
<i>who's able to be both corporate
 and slightly hood."</i>

00:01:46.539 --> 00:01:49.542
<i>I was like, "I need to be her."</i>

00:01:50.410 --> 00:01:52.078
<i> When I first met
 the real-life Molly,</i>

00:01:52.178 --> 00:01:56.916
<i> we were at a mutual friend's
birthday party and Issa's like,</i>

00:01:57.016 --> 00:02:00.753
<i> "Oh, I gotta introduce you
 to her." And so we go,</i>

00:02:00.853 --> 00:02:02.688
<i> and we kind of look
 at each other, we like hug,</i>

00:02:02.788 --> 00:02:04.456
<i>then we're kind of going around
 in a circle like,</i>

00:02:04.556 --> 00:02:08.194
<i> "Oh my God! You have
big eyes too! She has big eyes!"</i>

00:02:08.294 --> 00:02:09.695
<i> And then it's like,
 we start like,</i>

00:02:09.795 --> 00:02:12.665
<i>talking about each other's body
 parts and then a song came on.</i>

00:02:12.765 --> 00:02:14.901
<i> I started dancing,
 she started dancing,</i>

00:02:15.001 --> 00:02:17.069
<i> and we were like getting low
 on the dance floor.</i>

00:02:17.169 --> 00:02:18.804
<i> It's like,
 "She can dance like me!"</i>

00:02:18.904 --> 00:02:21.841
<i> It's so crazy because we had
 never met prior to that,</i>

00:02:21.941 --> 00:02:23.776
<i>we were just like, "Look at us,
 we are twins,</i>

00:02:23.876 --> 00:02:24.644
<i> we were meant to be."</i>

00:02:25.011 --> 00:02:27.646
<i> And so, we posted the picture
 with the hashtag</i>

00:02:27.746 --> 00:02:29.315
<i> SheIsMe AndIAmHer.</i>

00:02:29.415 --> 00:02:32.252
<i> And Issa's like, "I know,
 I did well. Good casting."</i>

00:02:32.985 --> 00:02:35.155
(TV STATIC)

